er Dupree.",1,3,6,"3132046","30558","Three Point Jump Shot"],[2,"0:27","248",62,46,0,0,"Foul on Morris Dunnigan.",0,25,0,"4066451","519","PersonalFoul"],[2,"0:21","41",62,46,0,3,"Christian Vital missed Three Point Jumper.",1,9,17,"4066443","30558","Three Point Jump Shot"],[2,"0:21","248",62,46,0,0,"Armoni Brooks Defensive Rebound.",0,25,0,"4066450","587","Defensive Rebound"],[2,"0:00",null,62,46,0,0,"End of Game",0,50,-5,null,"402","End Game"]],"wp":[],"article":{"headline":"Houston holds UConn to 12 points in 1st half, wins 62-46","description":"Rob Gray scored 20 points and Houston held UConn to 12 first-half points in a 62-46 victory on Wednesday.","type":"Recap","source":"Associated Press","published":"2016-12-28T22:17:36Z","story":"HARTFORD, Conn. --  Rob Gray scored 20 points and Houston held UConn to 12 first-half points in a 62-46 victory on Wednesday.\n\n<a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/player/_/id/61319/danrad-knowles\">Danrad Knowles</a> and <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/player/_/id/61674/damyean-dotson\">Damyean Dotson</a> each added 10 points for the Cougars (10-3), who never trailed in the American Athletic Conference opener for both schools. Houston dominated in the paint, outscoring UConn 26-12.\n\n<a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/player/_/id/4066443/christian-vital\">Christian Vital</a> led UConn (5-7) with 15 points, while <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/player/_/id/4066442/vance-jackson\">Vance Jackson</a> and <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/player/_/id/61157/rodney-purvis\">Rodney Purvis</a> each had 12. For the second time this season, the Huskies were held without a block as 7-foot center <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/player/_/id/66679/amida-brimah\">Amida Brimah</a> played just 14 minutes due to foul trouble.\n\nThe Huskies were just 3-for-21 shooting from the field in the first half to go with nine turnovers and just one assist. UConn shot 33.3 percent overall and had just four turnovers in the second half, but trailed throughout by double digits.","images":[{"url":"https://espnmedia-cdn.akamaized.net/espn/media/common/fastclipper/2016/1228/evc_NCB_20161228_Houston_vs_Connecticut_18f1393936524069bb0f92ae62601a7c/evc_NCB_20161228_Houston_vs_Connecticut_18f1393936524069bb0f92ae62601a7c.jpg","caption":"Rob Gray Jr. knocks down a 3-pointer to extend Houston's lead.","credit":null,"width":576,"height":324}]},"videos":[{"id":18365165,"headline":"Christian Vital buries the three to end the 13-0 HOU run","description":"Christian Vital made Three Point Jumper. Assisted by Rodney Purvis.","duration":19,"thumbnail":"https://espnmedia-cdn.akamaized.net/espn/media/common/fastclipper/2016/1228/evc_NCB_20161228_Houston_vs_Connecticut_f2cea628113b451c8811ca2ff16aac4b/evc_NCB_20161228_Houston_vs_Connecticut_f2cea628113b451c8811ca2ff16aac4b.jpg","published":"2016-12-28T20:26:07Z","links":{"mp4":"https://espnmedia-cdn.akamaized.net/espn/media/16x9/fastclipper/2016/1228/evc_NCB_20161228_Houston_vs_Connecticut_f2cea628113b451c8811ca2ff16aac4b/evc_NCB_20161228_Houston_vs_Connecticut_f2cea628113b451c8811ca2ff16aac4b.mp4","hls":"https://cmp-espn.media.dssott.com/opp/hls/espn/fastclipper/2016/1228/evc_NCB_20161228_Houston_vs_Connecticut_f2cea628113b451c8811ca2ff16aac4b/evc_NCB_20161228_Houston_vs_Connecticut_f2cea628113b451c8811ca2ff16aac4b/playlist.m3u8","web":"http://www.espn.com/video/clip?id=18365165"}},{"id":18365198,"headline":"Purvis gets the and-1 on difficult layup in transition","description":"Rodney Purvis finds a seam and makes a tough layup plus the foul.","duration":28,"thumbnail":"https://espnmedia-cdn.akamaized.net/espn/media/common/fastclipper/2016/1228/evc_NCB_20161228_Houston_vs_Connecticut_1bee22fc94ca4b0cad4290feda2f9c7d/evc_NCB_20161228_Houston_vs_Connecticut_1bee22fc94ca4b0cad4290feda2f9c7d.jpg","published":"2016-12-28T20:31:49Z","links":{"mp4":"https://espnmedia-cdn.akamai